# The JJ take corpus stays LOCAL and is deliberately not published.
#
# It is derived from transcribed podcast episodes. The repo is public (GitHub
# Pages serves from it), and pushing 16 MB of someone else's transcribed show
# to a public URL is a copyright problem we do not need. It lives on disk and
# in OneDrive, which is where a dormant archive belongs.
dormant/

# Local scratch
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
node_modules/
*.log

# Junk this session could not delete (the device bridge blocks unlink).
# Safe to delete by hand in Explorer.
_to_delete/
